  "description": "Common parts of the beat trackers VL.Audio.BeatNet and VL.Audio.BTrack for vvvv gamma; installed with them, so you don't need to install it yourself. It contains the BeatScaler node (one beat per bar, a quarter to quadruple tempo, following a tapped tempo; counts bars of any length for any tracker), BeatInfo (all values of a beat on one link), tap tempo and WAV I/O.",
